---
---
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
<title>Mystic North Productions</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{background:#0a0e12;color:#e8f1f5;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI;min-height:100vh}
.bg{position:fixed;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(70% 50% at 50% 0%, rgba(90,255,200,0.18), transparent), radial-gradient(50% 30% at 80% 15%, rgba(130,120,255,0.15), transparent), #080c10;z-index:-2}
.hero{text-align:center;padding:10vh 6vw 6vh}
.top{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:4px;opacity:.6;margin-bottom:18px}
h1{font-size:clamp(32px,6vw,58px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;line-height:1}
.tag{color:#7ff0c5;letter-spacing:3px;margin:16px 0 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(13px,2vw,16px)}
.loc{opacity:.7;font-size:14px}
.motto{margin-top:14px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:4px;opacity:.5}
.btns{margin-top:36px;display:flex;gap:14px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn{padding:14px 28px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:13px;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block}
.btn1{background:#7ff0c5;color:#051410}
.btn2{border:1px solid rgba(127,240,197,0.4);color:#7ff0c5;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04)}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;max-width:1000px;margin:50px auto;padding:0 5vw}
.card{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border-radius:12px;padding:22px;text-align:left}
.card h3{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;margin-bottom:6px;color:#7ff0c5}
.card p{font-size:13px;opacity:.7;line-height:1.5}
.list{max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px 5vw 40px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px;font-size:13px;opacity:.8}
.list b{color:#fff}
footer{text-align:center;padding:30px;opacity:.4;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);margin-top:40px}
@media(max-width:700px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.list{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="bg"></div>
<div class="hero">
<div class="top">MARKSTAY, ON • MOBILE ACROSS NORTHERN ONTARIO</div>
<h1>MYSTIC NORTH PRODUCTIONS</h1>
<div class="tag">MUSIC PRODUCTION STUDIO & LIVE SOUND EVENTS</div>
<div class="loc">Real Instruments • Real Room • Real Sound</div>
<div class="motto">PROFESSIONAL • RELIABLE • ON-THE-ROAD</div>
<div class="btns">
<a class="btn btn1" href="mailto:contact@mysticnorth.ca">BOOK STUDIO SESSION</a>
<a class="btn btn2" href="mailto:contact@mysticnorth.ca">LIVE SOUND / PA + TECH</a>
</div>
</div>

<div class="grid">
<div class="card"><h3>🎙️ STUDIO RECORDING</h3><p>Demos, singles, EPs. Live Sessions — real instruments on your tracks. Sound Design + Digital Production.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>🔊 LIVE SOUND EVENTS</h3><p>Full PA + Sound Tech. Weddings, bars, full bands & outdoor festivals. We bring the sound to you.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>🎸 BACKLINE & RENTAL</h3><p>Drums, amps, PA & backline rental. Rehearsal Space — hourly / monthly, backline included. By appointment.</p></div>
</div>

<div class="list">
<div>✅ <b>Sudbury • North Bay • Timmins & beyond</b> — mobile rig</div>
<div>✅ <b>All genres welcome:</b> Rock • Country • Weddings • Festivals</div>
<div>✅ <b>20+ years live + studio experience</b></div>
<div>✅ <b>DM to book your date</b> — contact@mysticnorth.ca</div>
</div>

<footer>© 2026 MYSTIC NORTH PRODUCTIONS • MYSTICNORTH.CA • MARKSTAY, ON</footer>
</body>
</html>
